<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/>
<title>Revue Instagram — {{ date_iso }}</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: #0f172a; color: #fff;
  }
  header {
    padding: 28px 20px 20px; text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  header h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 6px; letter-spacing: -0.2px; }
  header p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
  .warn { color: #f472b6; font-weight: 700; }
  .note {
    max-width: 640px; margin: 14px auto 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 14px;
  }
  .note code { color: #4ade80; }
  main { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 20px 60px; }
  section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
  section h2 {
    font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .card {
    background: #172038; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }
  .card.excluded { opacity: 0.4; }
  .card img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/5; object-fit: cover; display: block; background: #000; }
  .ribbon {
    position: absolute; top: 10px; left: 10px; background: #ef4444; color: #fff;
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .card-body { padding: 12px 14px 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; flex: 1; }
  .card-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; }
  .meta-row { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  .badge {
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .badge.source { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
  .badge.q-ok { background: rgba(74,222,128,0.15); color: #4ade80; }
  .badge.q-soft { background: rgba(250,204,21,0.15); color: #facc15; }
  .badge.q-low { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.18); color: #f87171; }
  .badge.q-unknown { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.15); color: #94a3b8; }
  .caption { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); line-height: 1.5; white-space: pre-line; }
  .caption-label {
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .hashtags { font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }
  .edit-link {
    margin-top: auto; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #4ade80;
    text-decoration: none; padding-top: 6px;
  }
  .edit-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .empty { text-align: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); padding: 60px 20px; }
  .upcoming-note {
    max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 20px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }
  .day-block { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .day-label {
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>Revue Instagram — {{ date_iso }}</h1>
  <p>
    {{ total_count }} candidat{{ 's' if total_count != 1 else '' }}
    {% if low_res_count %} · <span class="warn">{{ low_res_count }} en basse résolution</span>{% endif %}
  </p>
  <div class="note">
    Pour exclure un candidat avant sa publication : ouvrez « Modifier sur GitHub »,
    supprimez son bloc JSON (ou ajoutez <code>"excluded": true</code>) et commitez.
    Rien ne part sur Instagram avant la prochaine exécution planifiée.
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  {% if not groups %}
    <div class="empty">Aucun candidat Instagram généré pour cette date.</div>
  {% endif %}
  {% for group in groups %}
  <section>
    <h2>{{ group.label }} ({{ group.cards|length }})</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      {% for c in group.cards %}
      <div class="card{{ ' excluded' if c.excluded else '' }}">
        {% if c.excluded %}<span class="ribbon">Exclu</span>{% endif %}
        {% if c.file %}<img src="{{ c.file }}" alt="{{ c.title }}" loading="lazy"/>{% endif %}
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-title">{{ c.title }}</div>
          <div class="meta-row">
            <span class="badge source">{{ c.source_label }}</span>
            <span class="badge q-{{ c.quality }}">{{ c.quality_detail }}</span>
          </div>
          {% if c.caption %}
          <div class="caption-label">Texte sur l'image</div>
          <div class="caption">{{ c.caption }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if c.long_caption %}
          <div class="caption-label">Légende publiée</div>
          <div class="caption">{{ c.long_caption }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if c.hashtags %}<div class="hashtags">{{ c.hashtags|join(' ') }}</div>{% endif %}
          <a class="edit-link" href="{{ c.edit_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Modifier sur GitHub →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}

  {% if upcoming_days %}
  <section>
    <h2>À venir ({{ upcoming_days|map(attribute='cards')|map('length')|sum }})</h2>
    <div class="upcoming-note">
      Événements déjà en base qui redeviendront éligibles à une Story sur une date future,
      d'après leur planning actuel. Projection, pas une garantie : elle suppose qu'aucun
      nouvel article n'arrive et que rien d'autre n'est publié entre-temps.
    </div>
    {% for day in upcoming_days %}
    <div class="day-block">
      <div class="day-label">{{ day.date_iso }}</div>
      <div class="grid">
        {% for c in day.cards %}
        <div class="card">
          {% if c.file %}<img src="{{ c.file }}" alt="{{ c.title }}" loading="lazy"/>{% endif %}
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-title">{{ c.title }}</div>
            <div class="meta-row">
              <span class="badge source">{{ c.source_label }}</span>
              <span class="badge q-{{ c.quality }}">{{ c.quality_detail }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="caption">{{ c.date_range }}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}
</main>

</body>
</html>
